{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6a2d4b38f9b52ffb0807b3126d22491d02c79556b70630767edd03e482ab11df", "ja": "（39プロジェクトの開始に合わせ、美希の宣材写真も\n一新することに。今はその撮影中だ）", "zh": "（为了配合39PROJECT的开始，美希的\n宣传照也要重拍。目前正在拍摄新照片。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1001_se", "source_sha256": "09c36fe759dfb0f9d93528356042cc6688df11e26acd1e00d3d29b863019db67", "ja": "カシャカシャカシャカシャ！", "zh": "喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓喀嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f44768d451e366bdd87d1fb84cf00effa73ff4ed88ec3211450abb3ef869784c", "ja": "（シャッターを切るほど、美希のセンスは輝きを増して\nいく。充実した撮影時間は、瞬く間に過ぎ去った……）", "zh": "（快门声响得越多，美希拍照的神情也更加耀眼动人。\n充实的拍摄时间，一下便结束了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "8c1e388974e9cb9460cd880b008c89e8c8f2566954f4126f35ee05fc8f476204", "ja": "お疲れさまなの、{$P$}！\nミキ、晩ごはんはおにぎりがいいな♪", "zh": "辛苦了唷，{$P$}！\n美希晚餐想吃饭团♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "54e1ab6e9251a76c917dceb02114c2f3863b902d6b6e8a812caf3e1a48bba340", "ja": "そうだな。だいぶ早く済んだことだし、撮影前に\n美希が言ってたお店に行こうか。ええと……。", "zh": "也好，既然拍摄工作这么早就结束了，\n我们就去美希在拍摄前讲的那家店吧。就是那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "7f8c3bf1909c55078f55baf98af6119679ea3fc04a4858ff8503df57702000ce", "ja": "おにぎりカフェ！\nちゃんと覚えててくれたんだね。あはっ♪", "zh": "饭团咖啡厅！\n你还记得呢，啊哈♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1006_p", "source_sha256": "adc233515c4b889d2e353754afc1843da327066846e65a998da9452a774ce856", "ja": "いい写真も撮れたし、ゴホウビってことで。\n新人じゃないとはいえ、本当に見事だったよ。", "zh": "反正也拍到了好照片，就当作是奖励你。\n虽说你已经不是新人了，但这次是真的表现很棒。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "58d7f0098be6943895b0ac943ffeac5d97809ecd0fcf6fb900dc37a1153dde9b", "ja": "だってミキ、毎日成長してるから。\n……確かめてみる？", "zh": "因为美希天天都在成长呀。\n……你要确认一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4a3d6736c0b352f5044dd3b586385f82449086eb70a843536eae13493d036bca", "ja": "……確かめなくても、わかってるから。\nほら、早く支度してきて。", "zh": "……不用确认我也明白。\n来，赶快收拾收拾吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1009_003mik", "source_sha256": "7afbdf9fa7794e6722ac0abb48a79f5fd9edad23a99ee2adc6d1c0eca76bf312", "ja": "むー、つまんないの。ミキをこんなにしたのは、\n{$P$}なんだよ？", "zh": "唔～真是不好玩。害美希变成这样的，\n可是{$P$}耶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "ccb20b65bd4686741d86c5140fef64502f1c79d532859812702556b76e8fa426", "ja": "ちゃんと責任とってほしいって思うな♪", "zh": "人家希望你能好好负起责任♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "078793ff66e9aefc16f9e9bd8c61b3934ccef3c2812fae9816294734da9b3f00", "ja": "なんか人聞きが悪いような……。\nまあ、以後、気を付けるよ。", "zh": "怎么感觉这说法有点难听……\n好啦，我以后会注意的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "5c7038432ee79d1e6c991249dc91979dab9f32ebfa7d0b0627224cdd759272a4", "ja": "あ、そういえば……。\n新人のコたちの撮影も、もう始まってるの？", "zh": "啊，讲到这个……\n新人们也开始拍照了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8c527ad07798083532730adec03e9b6ad1c9d036cff9c95346c864fe10d5a5cd", "ja": "ああ、始まってるけど……どうしたんだ？", "zh": "对啊，是开始了……怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "99858b8ce20b01a28addad57bf9405e89d3f395de9b9248b74fc2c7f68364164", "ja": "{$P$}、ちゃんとミキの時\nみたいに、写真撮ってる間、ほめてあげてる？", "zh": "{$P$}，那你有像在看\n美希拍照的时候一样，一直夸奖她们吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "d68c329669b15ff7750aee19908e9bf521125f1d62c41f13da6f3b661a83ffe5", "ja": "ほめて？　いや、特にほめてはいないような……。\nというか、美希の時もほめてたっけ？", "zh": "夸奖？呃，我想应该是没有……\n是说美希在拍照的时候我有夸你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1016_003mik", "source_sha256": "10a30932ed7ba49e05a1be397926da1dd62fe0133580d7da0229ed8c84d7dd2e", "ja": "うん、いっぱいほめてくれてるの。心の中で！", "zh": "嗯，夸了好多好多喔，在心里面！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "ca8921c12bb87be91f7767e2fc88c23f21cee0756f1b8d3777827fb5f3734587", "ja": "ミキ、目を見ればだいたいわかるから。ほめてるか、\n別のこと考えてるか、エッチなとこ見てるか♪", "zh": "美希，只要看眼睛就知道你在想什么。是在夸奖美希，\n在想别的事情，还是在看色色的地方之类的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1018_p", "source_sha256": "19b517361eb57764a7697d472e997d14b542613b5097b1cdf344729b2e76a304", "ja": "な、なるほど……。", "zh": "原、原来如此……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1019_003mik", "source_sha256": "2196646e70a45b55401c46211adb5e26df73678c1868d3ee6132f3fb7b2ad9d4", "ja": "ほめてもらえてるとね、よかったって思って。\nそれで、どんどんノれるんだよ。自分でもわかるし♪", "zh": "被你夸奖的时候，美希就会觉得很开心。\n然后自己也会感觉到对工作越来越有兴致呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "8091eb35ebd4aa0e977c5cba494cc53f88f64bc66e944905b5004c4bafa1bcc8", "ja": "……確かに、撮影には何より、自信が必要だしな。\nでも、カメラマンさんもほめてくれてないか？", "zh": "……的确，拍摄时最重要的就是自信。\n不过，摄影师不也一直在夸你吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "7f3397537e8b5e0be6930db1c829fcf5d9e4470f4baf0608523096dd5a6df892", "ja": "ほめてくれてるけどー、{$P$}の\n目の方が、絶対効くって思うな！", "zh": "有是有啦～可是美希觉得\n{$P$}的眼神一定更有效！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c4ff4ea4b9ca924812b7330b3cb5c9374ba7fed4634fc37d8e319420831c96b2", "ja": "そういうもんか……。アドバイスありがとう、美希。\nとても参考になったよ。でも……", "zh": "是这样吗……谢谢你的建议，美希。\n让我受益良多，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1023", "source_sha256": "f04cb1cad5b731f45a755a3fdc852ed70366ef9534fa67ce362742ad2e08bc9d", "ja": "よかったのか？", "zh": "这样好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_1024_p", "source_sha256": "f6a8e0180e3297898f882fdb8ab2f20a07c92f1adb7c8f20be8c11e131e0f571", "ja": "新人のためのアドバイスなんて、よかったのか？\nカンタンには負けない、とか言ってたような……。", "zh": "为了新人给我建议，这样好吗？\n你不是说了自己不会轻易认输之类的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2000_003mik", "source_sha256": "98948951e38c5580af56ffbe6addb3953c38293d27e65665a583c59074092a2b", "ja": "あ、そういえばそうだったの。", "zh": "啊，这么说起来好像是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2001_003mik", "source_sha256": "e21310ff38e102bd2fb74d834cae16abbdd3c3f3666a1d15c96ceced9c2936df", "ja": "でも、みんなのいい写真が撮れた方が、\n{$P$}はうれしいでしょ？", "zh": "不过，看到大家都拍出好照片，\n{$P$}会更开心不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2002_p", "source_sha256": "de9d16234af1437e7c59b94b8101997b769e91b68df631dce234d1a678a70dc5", "ja": "もちろん。", "zh": "这是当然。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2003_003mik", "source_sha256": "e5d39bdec3352ff5ab1ed1727069f29f9b47a1a153172a3b08c1213c8be468aa", "ja": "なら、ミキ的にはオッケーってカンジ♪　あはっ！", "zh": "那么，美希个人就是OK的感觉♪啊哈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2004_p", "source_sha256": "6924805f73d8f95ae6c519aa51b0e76e8bcc66941958afc87614bf027cf820ce", "ja": "美希……。", "zh": "美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2005_p", "source_sha256": "89c5648432dc1c8596cf063f8b6a7b10acf69c5cb498d6469fc78a2dab72bc70", "ja": "（美希は美希のままでいい……。\n先輩としても、実は同じことが言えたのかもしれない）", "zh": "（美希维持现在这个样子就好……\n即便站在前辈的立场，她说不定也会说出一样的话。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2006_p", "source_sha256": "28ecb48f6fcac17d4c0542fdf2561ac65a14ed5ca4ebc2ed05309397f4d6b44a", "ja": "（美希は美希のまま、そのままにふるまうだけで、\n充分に立派な先輩として……）", "zh": "（美希不需刻意改变自己，光是平常的行为举止，\n就已经是个了不起的前辈了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2007_003mik", "source_sha256": "641c312a1093a1af69dc2fc36df0cfe83a33c56404d01dbf0c4c5f4ded182c80", "ja": "じゃ、さっそく練習ね。{$P$}、\n今からミキのこと、いっぱい見て、いっぱいほめて？", "zh": "那就要赶紧练习了呢。{$P$}，\n接下来你要练习好好看着美希，好好夸夸美希哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2008_p", "source_sha256": "59002e27323de01cb63dc0ad9b419a3eeae196b1ac47c0d7d6355bcc3a5c09f8", "ja": "えっ。……練習も何も、美希の撮影の時に\nちゃんとできてたんじゃないのか？", "zh": "咦……怎么还需要练习，\n美希在拍摄时我不是做得不错吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2009_003mik", "source_sha256": "4539432234500458cc6b7df3ff8b79cd85c0c756403e5860933001d5fc939dc3", "ja": "ミキの時にできても、他のコの時にできるとは\n限らないって思うな♪", "zh": "美希觉得，就算你在美希拍照时做得到，\n换成其他女生时也不见得做得到呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2010_p", "source_sha256": "bdcb88c6d4344dc8f3a88d82d33420d90850a57abd149025e8549a1e986e5834", "ja": "（また、部分的にスジの通ったことを……！）", "zh": "（又讲这种乍听之下很有道理的话……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2011_003mik", "source_sha256": "568ca41d764977807cceec5d632817cb82acac2c892621cce4e5e5fe22e40470", "ja": "ほらほら、新しいコたちのために～。\nミキのこと、いっぱい見つめて……、ね♪", "zh": "快点快点，为了新来的偶像们～\n你要好好注视着美希……知道吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2012_p", "source_sha256": "068a24a532a18756019a10a14c8117f44f132433a464e94bd4d98f078f787a18", "ja": "ダメダメ。今日の仕事はもう終わったんだから。\nオフはちゃんと体を休めないと……。", "zh": "不行不行，今天的工作已经结束了。\n没有工作时就该让身体好好休息……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2013_003mik", "source_sha256": "8d45753f01c83e453c8a8d8835a6c47fc2163c573a1423e81d767255d6523018", "ja": "ミキはすっごく、リラックスしてるよ？\nミキのこと、オフでいっぱい見つめて……、ね♪", "zh": "美希现在，可是非～常放松哦。\n没工作时也要好好注视着美希……知道吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_003mik_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_003mik_002_2015_p", "source_sha256": "11c4965c79e067f06a5c91f45f112fd73315cf6830b1dc4ab74e8aea35bb6f3a", "ja": "（間違いなく、どこまでいっても美希は美希のままか。\nこれからも、気を抜くヒマはなさそうだ……）", "zh": "（毫无疑问，美希不管怎样都不会变。\n看来今后也不容我有片刻大意呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
